usage: build_model.py [-h] --model MODEL --out OUT

Build an isolated check/capture/hybrid host with the ordinary model plan. The
compiler shim changes only the final link sources. Import capture calls pass
straight to hipcc. All actual arguments are recorded. No shared file is
rewritten. The extra C6 kernel is a separate entry in the model executable.

options:
  -h, --help     show this help message and exit
  --model MODEL
  --out OUT
